  update_crc_64[we]                2000 cases
  update_crc_ccitt[init=0x1D0F]    2000 cases
  update_crc_ccitt[init=0xFFFF]    2000 cases
  update_crc_ccitt[init=0x0000]    2000 cases
  update_crc_dnp                   2000 cases
  update_crc_kermit                2000 cases
  update_crc_sick                  2000 cases

  checksum_NMEA has no incremental form in libcrc, hence 12 rather than 13.
  update_crc_64 is used for both CRC-64 seeds. The header's documented
  update_crc_64_ecma() cannot be called at all — see UPSTREAM NOTE below.

